subsidies.objectDetail:
Key supported entrepreneurship groups (below statutory retirement age, not yet receiving basic pension, meeting any one of the following):
1. Students from regular universities, vocational and technical schools (enrolled or within 5 years of graduation) and overseas returnees within 5 years of graduation;
2. Veterans;
3. Registered unemployed persons in the province;
4. Recognized employment-disadvantaged persons in the province;
5. Returning entrepreneurs (three categories);
6. Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan residents under 45.

